    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the leaves but i don't really see any bugs or anything like spider mites. the soil feels pretty damp though, even when i try to let it dry out. could it be a drainage issue? how would i know if the roots are actually rotting?",
      "source": "evaluator"
